+# Symlink fixture
+
+`symlinks.sqfs` contains the same files and links as `symlinkMembers` in
+`../../symlinks_test.go`. The tests read this image directly, so they do not
+require squashfs tools or permission to create local symlinks.
+
+To recreate it with `mksquashfs`, run from this directory, using a fresh
+`input` directory and removing the old output first:
+
+```sh
+mkdir -p input/src
+printf hello > input/src/file.txt
+printf 'ordinary file' > input/src/file.txt.rclonelink
+ln -s file.txt input/src/link.txt
+ln -s ../missing input/src/dangling
+ln -s . input/src/dirlink
+ln -s file.txt input/src/suffixed.rclonelink
+ln -s src/file.txt input/rootlink
+mksquashfs input symlinks.sqfs -noappend -no-xattrs -all-root \
+    -all-time 1700000000 -mkfs-time 1700000000
+```
